      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.faulknerhistory.org/communities/twin-groves/"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "U.S. Route 65 cuts through Twin Groves’ eastern side, heading 18 miles south to Conway and 21 miles north to Clinton.",
